chapter|Main book division matches village-introduction example; chapter is not a page or paragraph. Vietnamese maintains opening position and residents; figurative life-stage sense not claimed covered.
endorsement|Public approval is broader than paid advertising. Residents' association statement matches noun boundary; neither source rights clearance nor actual owner approval is inferred from this illustrative sentence.
initiative|New plan and independent action are distinct supported noun meanings. Library aim and assistant action align separately in Vietnamese; article distinction and on one's own initiative checked.
ordeal|Difficult experience is stronger than a routine task and not a neutral test. Walkers in storm fit distress context; Vietnamese does not add injury, duration or a rescue absent from English.
sailor|Crew member and person skilled at sailing share an agent boundary rather than artificial employment split. Rope check example is original, with experience and departure timing preserved in Vietnamese.
